  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accompanying processes and communities in organisational processes and human rights advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports core work of our partner CODACOP in the accompaniment communities, processes and social organisations, who fight against all forms of aggression and recreate areas for collective emancipation, seeking to have an impact on changing their living conditions and on the real construction of peace and democracy. 
A strong component of CODACOP&apos;s work is focussed on working with Indigenous women, especially to address gender-based violence. In this project this will be focused on the establishment of an Observatory of Violence against Indigenous Women in the Resguardo Ca&#xf1;amomo Lomaprieta-Riosucio (Caldas).</narrative>
  </description>
